# Deny-by-default build context. Every Dockerfile in this repo uses the repo
# root as its build context (docker/Dockerfile, docker/Dockerfile.release, and
# docker/profile/Dockerfile.profile all COPY from `.`), so anything not
# explicitly re-included below never reaches the daemon and can't land in an
# image layer or a `COPY . .` stage.
#
# Keep in sync with the actual COPY/ADD instructions when a Dockerfile changes
# what it needs — packaging/deb/dockerignore_test.sh asserts sentinel files
# stay out of the `test` stage's /src.
*

# ---- Go build (docker/Dockerfile `build`/`test` stages: COPY . .) ----------
!go.mod
!go.sum
!NOTICE
!cmd
!cmd/**
!internal
!internal/**
!third_party
!third_party/**

# ---- rules pipeline (all three Dockerfiles: docker/fetch-rules.sh etc.) ----
!docker
!docker/*.sh
!docker/*.py
!docker/Dockerfile
!docker/Dockerfile.release
!docker/local-rules
!docker/local-rules/**
!docker/profile
!docker/profile/Dockerfile.profile
!docker/profile/profile.c

# ---- smoke test (CI docker job: scripts/smoke.sh strixd:ci) ----------------
!scripts
!scripts/smoke.sh

# Everything else stays denied, including but not limited to:
#   .git/                    - VCS metadata, never needed in an image
#   .claude/                 - agent config
#   .github/                 - CI workflow definitions
#   contrib/, packaging/     - not consumed by any Dockerfile COPY/ADD
#   rules*/                  - transient smoke-suite rule dirs (gitignored;
#                               scripts/smoke.sh creates rules*/ in the tree)
#   /testdata/               - the gitignored live-samples corpus at the repo
#                               ROOT. Note internal/*/testdata/ fixtures DO
#                               reach the context via !internal/** — the test
#                               stage's `go test ./...` needs them.
#   secrets/, *.token, .env* - deploy-time secrets (gitignored)
#   *.log, coverage.txt      - build/test output (gitignored)
#   *.test, /strixd, /strix-scan, /strix-milter, /dist/, /out/, /debout/
#                             - compiled test/release binaries (gitignored)
